		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  DELETE avec ORDER BY et LIMIT...]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=9944#p9944"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />&#160; une requête imbriquée ?</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code> DELETE FROM table WHERE id IN (SELECT id FROM table WHERE creator_id = 50 ORDER BY time_creation DESC LIMIT 50)</code></pre></div><p>Attention, non testée.</p><p>Cordialement</p>]]></content>
